[Music]  the be active workplace award recognizes  and celebrates outstanding initiatives  in the workplace encouraging employees  to be physically active  the 2021 recipient of the ward was  hungarian company idata kft specialized  in the development of gps tracking  software and hardware with most of its  employees working on the company's gps  tracking system day in and day out  mostly in front of their computers  promoting physical activity and  well-being has always been a priority  for idata kft  the company's sound mind in a sound body  program launched in 2016 provides  incentives to be active in two ways  individual sports activities and  community events on the individual level  employees are encouraged to collect  points according to a predefined scoring  system for countless sports activities  ranging from aerobic over yoga to  kayaking  friendly competitions are promoted  between employees and teams with awards  such as athlete of the month or most  sporty employee  this friendly competition increased  employee participation every year since  the launch of the program boasting a  current 84 participation rate  at the community level activities  involved not only employees but also  their friends and family with so-called  family day sporting events the last of  which welcomed over 180 participants  to round off its comprehensive approach  to well-being of the workplace idata kft  also offers its employees sessions with  two full-time psychologists as mental  and physical health go hand in hand half  of our colleagues started to sport part  of because our new sport program what we  started six years ago it is the most  important thing and the most important  benefit for us

